---
version: 2.0.2
title: check help
file: ./test/licence_audit/output_snapshot_test.gleam
test_name: check_help_test
---
Enforce selected checks: licences (default), vulns, or all. Licence checks
require a licence policy. Vulnerability-only checks do not evaluate licence
policy or fetch licence metadata.

Command: check

USAGE:
    licence_audit check [ --cache-dir=<DIR> --checks=<licences|vulns|all>
        --color=<auto|always|never> --config=<PATH> --format=<text|json>
        --ignore-config --manifest=<PATH> --no-cache --quiet --scope=<prod|all>
        --verbose --vuln-block-unknown --vuln-severity=<low|medium|high|critical> ]

FLAGS:
    --cache-dir=<DIR>                           Use DIR as the application cache
                                                root for all cache families

    --checks=<licences|vulns|all>               Select checks:
                                                licences|vulns|all (default
                                                licences); licences and all
                                                require a licence policy

    --color=<auto|always|never>                 Colorize output:
                                                auto|always|never (default auto;
                                                alias: --colour)

    --config=<PATH>                             Read configuration from PATH

    --format=<text|json>                        Output format: text|json
                                                (default text)

    --help                                      Print help information

    --ignore-config                             Ignore configuration files

    --manifest=<PATH>                           Read manifest from PATH

    --no-cache                                  Bypass the on-disk caches

    --quiet                                     Suppress progress output (alias:
                                                -q)

    --scope=<prod|all>                          Dependency scope: prod|all
                                                (production only or all
                                                dependencies)

    --verbose                                   Show detailed progress output
                                                (alias: -v)

    --vuln-block-unknown                        Fail on advisories whose
                                                severity is unknown (true or
                                                false overrides config; default
                                                false; requires --checks=vulns
                                                or --checks=all)

    --vuln-severity=<low|medium|high|critical>  Minimum blocking vulnerability
                                                severity:
                                                low|medium|high|critical
                                                (overrides config; default high;
                                                requires --checks=vulns or
                                                --checks=all)

